+/*
+ * Note FE (0445): camera stage 5, one frame of the front camera into memory (kern.notefe_cam=5), each layer reported
+ * on its own (the advisor's plan): the sensor (its mode read back, its frame counter 0x0005 after stream-on), the link
+ * (CSIS2's D-PHY status, interrupt sources, frame counter), the DMA (DMA0's byte count; three 256 KB windows of the
+ * buffer pre-filled with 0xA5 and how much of each changed), the SysMMU (its status after). Order as Samsung's
+ * csi_stream_on + csi_hw_enable (fimc-is-device-csi_v2.c, fimc-is-hw-csi-v4_0.c): SysMMU 0x141e0000 (CSIS2's, by the
+ * DTB's master list) from 0x3 (CTRL_BLOCK_DISABLE: the master stalls) to 0 (CTRL_DISABLE: bypass) for the run; the
+ * MIPI PHY's PMU isolation 0x714 bit 0 bypassed and its reset (0x145f1050 bit 1) released; CSIS SW reset, every VC's
+ * DMA off, settle 22 (Samsung's cfg for 2608x1960@30), 2 lanes, CH0 VC0 RAW10 (0x2b, double clock) 2608 x 1960, DMA0
+ * 2D, normal packing, all eight frame pointers at 0xd0800000 (the camera ION range, outside XNU at the stock RAM
+ * level; 0xd8000000 is the bootloader framebuffer), shadow update, D-PHY clock, CSI on; then the sensor streams for
+ * 1.5 s. Everything put back as found on the way out. Only 768 KB of the buffer is mapped (io_submap is 8 MB).
+ */
+/* S5K4E6 init + 2608x1960 RAW10 2-lane mode: register facts from the MediaTek (Meizu m685) s5k4e6mipiraw_Sensor.c */
+/* sensor_init() + preview_setting() (GPL; values only), cross-checked with Allwinner sunxi-vin s5k4e6yx.c */
